invariant: INV-16
file: src/rsa_sign.c
catches: rsa_sign_test
reason: blinded_exponent's passes add t under a zero mask, so the
  exponent ends at d and the ladder walks d itself in every signature.
  Power or emission traces of many signatures then line up on one
  exponent again (docs/decisions.md 186). Every signature is still
  correct, so no vector sees it. run_exponent reads the exponent through
  rsa_sign.h's test entry, against d + r (65537 d - 1) computed with
  plain products.

--- old
        blind_pass(exponent, t, exponent_words, opaque);
--- new
        blind_pass(exponent, t, exponent_words, opaque & 0U);
